   "id": "Q_vesuvius_p1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Q_vesuvius_p1** · question\n\nCan we reproduce PHerc. 343 w047/w048 bit-identically against SHA256SUMS, re-render the 66-layer surface from S3 PHerc0343 8.64 um volume, run all 4 public 9 um ink models, and achieve Pearson r >= 0.90 in the credited 4 cm^2 window (p1)?",
